 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年的11月，庄园主Oscar来啦，他带来了更完整和更新的核桃树信息；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我把Oscar准备的ppt里的内容摘录一些如下：\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n          有关于庄园根据不同的品种在产季中的产量/质量分布来做不同产品的分类的逻辑思路\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicUDRGdiagbCkktSic98mWIiczv2hsdIKGibuCh8W6KjAO23JjQodoZFuRRg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicr2CYwRjz2mmsCDErvEuwjGJVC4aHGHODbpmawBy638GZfnxKYsOwHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicckn0IzXAcx64Vkib2xZzChbPfycYmdic8973ykYDz8NF1guRTLFVGRIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n          有关于处理的热冲击/预发酵/发酵过程的\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicVQPZcicHJ3ZVibRHJicHagXuezQPericLegSicffRA3icQfgHRoD7ZDiaWhmQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicrVnjz3sDSho0AIfjn9XKPWkHJaictwahuq6ZmPvO1f1icFVMsicG9FXnA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGic9kB40jJJvGdibkIjcG9kceA8fUPWPBibQSUSNw9keW65UpbQ6CiciauPcQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cy